senses.gloss:
वि-डम्बयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, imitating, copying;
assuming, putting on (a borrowed dress or appear-
ance).

वि-डम्बित, अस्, आ, अम्, imitated, copied, assumed,
put on (as a borrowed from &c.), simulated, trans-
formed, distorted; mocked at, ridiculed, derided;
deceived, disappointed, frustrated; vexed, mortified;
distressed, low, poor, abject; (अम्), n. an object of
ridicule or contempt, despicable object.
